  "description": "T1 - Crab Apple growing in the front garden by the pavement. To crown reduce by up to 1.5m, or suitable growing points to control size and improve shape. To deadwood. To remove the pegs at the base and epicormic growth up to the first fork.\rT2 - Cherry tree in the front garden boarding the neighbours front garden on the left hand side. To fell to as low as possible above existing ground level as the tree has died.\rT3 - Cherry tree growing in the front garden on the right hand side by the front door. To crown thin by 25%. To remove any crossing, rubbing and dead branches.\rT4 - Cherry tree in the rear garden. To fell to as low as possible above existing ground level as the tree is in decline. To stump grind the resulting stump.",
